<title>USA: SI Diamond preliminary Q4 revs up.</title>
<headline>SI Diamond preliminary Q4 revs up.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SI Diamond Technology Inc said Thursday its fourth quarter ended December 31 revenues were $1,542,384, a 30 percent increase over the $1,185,172 in revenues during the 1995 fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The net loss from continuing operations was $1,597,336, a 77 percent decline from the $6,853,796 loss in the same period last year, the company said.</p>
<p>The loss per share of $0.16 compared to a net loss per share of $0.63 for the 1995 fourth quarter, the company said.</p>
</text>
